
# ── SGSD-managed entries (added by /sgsd-onboard) ────────────────────────────
# Per-machine SGSD state that should not be committed across machines.
# The agent registry, planning history, and milestone artifacts ARE committed
# (those are the project's intellectual capital). Only volatile per-run state
# is excluded here.

.planning/ORCHESTRATOR-CHECKPOINT.md
.planning/ORCHESTRATOR-LIVE.jsonl
.planning/metrics/codex-live.json
.planning/metrics/*-status.jsonl

# super-gsd/ may be a junction to a sibling install — don't commit if it's
# a symlink/junction (no useful diff, breaks across machines).
# (Comment line — git itself will commit junctions as either real dirs or
# nothing depending on git config; tune to your preference.)
